{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Hey Gina! What's up? How's the store going? I gotta tell you about this thing with my biz."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-ffe653d4d7179d93c31252de", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.528855+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ffe653d4d7179d93c31252de", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ffe653d4d7179d93c31252de", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Hey Jon! The store's doing great! It's a wild ride. How's the biz?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-48998c33356eb2a282bcebd7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.554506+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "48998c33356eb2a282bcebd7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "48998c33356eb2a282bcebd7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Hey Gina! I'm putting in a lot of work on my business even with the obstacles. I'm gonna make it happen!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-c9b6f2b86f919b544a60b403", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.571014+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c9b6f2b86f919b544a60b403", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c9b6f2b86f919b544a60b403", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Wow! You've got drive! Keep it up and you'll definitely make a splash."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-3203747bdd4297152d065f5c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.590127+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3203747bdd4297152d065f5c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3203747bdd4297152d065f5c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks Gina! Your help really means a lot. Sometimes it's hard when things don't go my way, but I'm sure if I keep pushing, I'll reach my dreams!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-6a300dec84d101634901b743", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.606795+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6a300dec84d101634901b743", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6a300dec84d101634901b743", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Understand where you're at, Jon. Setbacks are just opportunities for comebacks. You got the skills, passion, and drive. Plus my full support. Don't give up, buddy!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-7ea010a0de02703f51bc5b74", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.640147+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7ea010a0de02703f51bc5b74", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7ea010a0de02703f51bc5b74", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Setbacks can be tough, but with your support, I can handle anything. Appreciate you having my back!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-ed777a04f0edd86d741b3b7d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.663164+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ed777a04f0edd86d741b3b7d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ed777a04f0edd86d741b3b7d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: I'm here for you no matter what! Anything you want to say about your biz?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-47eee0a95c4fd419e78587bc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.680939+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "47eee0a95c4fd419e78587bc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "47eee0a95c4fd419e78587bc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Searching for a dance studio location has been tricky, but I'm determined to find the right spot - when I do, I'm sure the rest will follow!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-6e2d8c03f3f721c1cb99fe9b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.699986+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6e2d8c03f3f721c1cb99fe9b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6e2d8c03f3f721c1cb99fe9b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Searching for the perfect dance studio's a tough job, Jon. Hang in there and you'll find it soon!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-38bede8595c086595722bfe8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.727811+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "38bede8595c086595722bfe8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "38bede8595c086595722bfe8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Appreciate your encouragement - it means a lot! I'm working on my business and some new dance routines - rehearsing hard for an upcoming show. I'm passionate about dancing and it brings me so much joy and fulfillment."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-e1de07fd86bfdb32e2d61775", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.752144+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e1de07fd86bfdb32e2d61775", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e1de07fd86bfdb32e2d61775", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Wow, Jon! You're so talented! What show ya got planned?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-a25b402aea6cf31b6700d364", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.776194+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a25b402aea6cf31b6700d364", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a25b402aea6cf31b6700d364", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: I'm getting ready for a dance comp near me next month. It's a great chance for me to show my skillz and, hopefully, get some props from the dance fam. Super stoked!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-9f7238f5ef596b14e293b703", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.797698+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9f7238f5ef596b14e293b703", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9f7238f5ef596b14e293b703", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Wow Jon, you're gonna kill it in that competition. Your hard work and talent will pay off! Good luck."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-4cf3d2a73823178d43caf3ab", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.819682+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4cf3d2a73823178d43caf3ab", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4cf3d2a73823178d43caf3ab", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! Your help means a lot. I'll do my best to make you proud!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-aa04d721dae788c8711e1c19", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.841229+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "aa04d721dae788c8711e1c19", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "aa04d721dae788c8711e1c19", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: No doubt, Jon you've got this. Your passion and commitment are awesome! Keep it up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-e498ced1868dba5933a594b2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.857604+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e498ced1868dba5933a594b2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e498ced1868dba5933a594b2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks! I'm going for my dreams!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-5e85e4ef3e3144adbadf0b6b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.875905+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5e85e4ef3e3144adbadf0b6b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5e85e4ef3e3144adbadf0b6b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Gina: Absolutely Jon. I'm always here to cheer you on. Make your dreams happen - keep going and believe in yourself. You got this!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-0811baef2076ef8244a5f1ae", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.893427+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0811baef2076ef8244a5f1ae", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0811baef2076ef8244a5f1ae", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Jon: Thanks, Gina! Your kind words mean a lot. I won't give up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-locomo-conv-30/session_4-31cd84ae3bba5fa8740ac76d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T10:30:24.910148+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "31cd84ae3bba5fa8740ac76d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "31cd84ae3bba5fa8740ac76d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
